{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q9AYSXgWbjPhgTvsCt9oeZ","type":"tool_result","content":"</details>\n\n\n## Running this example\n\nAll scripts run from the repo root. Each one that uses the Vite config\nbuilds the Node entries (`npm run build:node`) first, because the config\nimports the stripping plugin from `dist/vite.js`.\n\n- `npm run start:hydration` -- start the Vite dev server with the Hono\n  app mounted under `/example-hydration/`, and open the index.\nexports without the alias. That command passes `--loader:.css=empty`\nso component-level `import './x.css'` side-effect imports are no-ops\nunder Node; without it esbuild refuses to bundle CSS to stdout.\n\nThat config imports the plugin from `../dist/vite.js` (the pre-built\nNode entry with `--packages=external`) instead of `./src/vite.js`,\nbecause Vite's config bundler inlines `require('typescript')` from\n`src/build.ts` and breaks in ESM context. The dist must be built\n(`npm run build:node`) before running Vite with it.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cc64cd6a-3638-45e4-b70b-6a40470d9ff5","uuid":"a05d2880-e5b4-4740-bb62-923981f644f4","timestamp":"2026-10-15T03:56:55.842Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"</details>\n\n\n## Running this example\n\nAll scripts run from the repo root. Each one that uses the Vite config\nbuilds the Node entries (`npm run build:node`) first, because the config\nimports the stripping plugin from `dist/vite.js`.\n\n- `npm run start:hydration` -- start the Vite dev server with the Hono\n  app mounted under `/example-hydration/`, and open the index.\nexports without the alias. That command passes `--loader:.css=empty`\nso component-level `import './x.css'` side-effect imports are no-ops\nunder Node; without it esbuild refuses to bundle CSS to stdout.\n\nThat config imports the plugin from `../dist/vite.js` (the pre-built\nNode entry with `--packages=external`) instead of `./src/vite.js`,\nbecause Vite's config bundler inlines `require('typescript')` from\n`src/build.ts` and breaks in ESM context. The dist must be built\n(`npm run build:node`) before running Vite with it.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/nick/code/microtags.hydration-dx-fixes-01-example-build-from-fresh-clone/example-hydration/vite.config.ts","hunks":[{"oldStart":4,"oldLines":7,"newStart":4,"newLines":7,"lines":[" import devServer from '@hono/vite-dev-server'"," import { readFile } from 'node:fs/promises'"," import { resolve } from 'node:path'","-import { microtags } from '../src/vite.js'","+import { microtags } from '../dist/vite.js'"," import type * as AppModule from './server/app.js'"," import type * as ScaffoldModule from './server/scaffold.js'"," "]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/nick/code/microtags.hydration-dx-fixes-01-example-build-from-fresh-clone/example-hydration/vite.config.ts"]}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Q9AYSXgWbjPhgTvsCt9oeZ","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
